        "TileImage": "$($repository 6a1d5a96-66d5-424e-9a94-cdada18d326a).Image",
        "Description": "Turns out that Kronstadt Industries has only few really important scientists and engineers. Eliminating them will stop or at least slow down their weapon production on mass scale. After few &quot;accidental&quot; deaths, a lot other workers probably will leave too.\rAnd that&apos;s what our client paid us to do.\r\rEliminate all 5 important Kronstadt assets and steal their helicopter.\rGood Luck 47.",
